<!--
    Inkbolt: the icon set. Square-cut, solid glyphs on a 24 grid, in the language of the source's menu: blocky controller tiles,
    thick bars, a hand, a padlock, a bolt. Drawn here, not traced from the game and not from an icon pack.
    IconTemplate draws a geometry at IconSize in the control's Foreground. Holes are drawn with the opposite winding.
    Playnite's menu icons keep their icofont glyphs; only their hardcoded colors move onto theme brushes.
-->
